Cell[BoxData["\<\"01_gauge_covariance.nb completed.\\n\\nPurpose:\\nValidate \
closed-loop gauge covariance of the polar holonomy estimator.\\n\\nExpected \
behavior:\\nGauge covariance residuals should be near machine \
precision.\\nUnitarity residuals should be near machine precision.\\nThe \
minimum overlap singular value should remain safely separated from \
zero.\\n\\nGenerated \
